<text x="40" y="338" font-family="monospace, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#333">1. Tab. Glimfora-M1 (glimepiride 1 mg + metformin 500 mg)</text>
<text x="40" y="366" font-family="monospace, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#333">   Dose: 1 tab OD before breakfast</text>
<text x="40" y="394" font-family="monospace, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#333">-------------------------------------------------------------------</text>
<text x="40" y="422" font-family="monospace, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#333">Advice: Monitor FBS and PPBS weekly. Watch for hypoglycemia symptoms.</text>
<text x="40" y="450" font-family="monospace, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#333">Repeat HbA1c and lipid profile in 8-12 weeks.</text>
